[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 248.789, "timestamp": "00:04:08", "text": "好的。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 250.789, "timestamp": "00:04:10", "text": "，我很好。你好嗎？我一切都很好。我剛思考完，交完作業後就回家了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 264.03, "timestamp": "00:04:24", "text": "出去了，摸了摸草地，騎著我的踏板車開了很久。我估計騎了3個小時，而且當時還下著大雨，刮著大風。當時風很大，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 273.766, "timestamp": "00:04:33", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hmph"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 278.385, "timestamp": "00:04:38", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "nice"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 285.15, "timestamp": "00:04:45", "text": "雨也很大，但我還是開車穿過了那裡。開車穿過那裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 288.95, "timestamp": "00:04:48", "text": "。  你知道我的，我總是先開車。眨眼。是的，我很安全。感謝上帝。幸好我平安無事。是的，感謝上帝，我在那裡很安全"}]